ervice healthy, with the error rate down to about 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 is open as SEV2 for checkout-api. It describes the failure, why v2.3.0 was chosen, the rollback, the check afterwards, and a follow-up item: find the root cause in v2.3.1 before deploying it again.", "type": "text"}]}]}